think The live edge is Season G open-media; the newest rung is image/polygon.rye. Its log named three crux-first agent-doable siblings: an edge-drawing render, a shape-match distance over the Hu vectors, and a Freeman chain code.
think Lindy-first crux-first among the three: the shape-match distance is highest-Lindy (a whole shape-recognition family descends from it -- the direct payoff of hu_moments, telling whether two shapes are the same regardless of turn, scale, mirror) and the hardest-solvable. The edge-drawing render is a leaf; the chain code a representation. The matcher opens recognition.
think Read hu_moments.rye for the HuSet interface (i1..i7), moments.rye and the hu_moments witness for the exact sibling style, and image/README.md to keep docs synced.
think Designed the metric before coding: Hu-matching by signed log sign(h)*log10(|h|) folds the huge dynamic range (i1~0.3, i7~1e-6) onto one comparable scale keeping sign; distance = sum of absolute signed-log differences (the classic OpenCV I2 form) -- a proper metric (zero-exact, symmetric). Two honest metrics from the same fusion: shape_distance over i1..i6 (mirror-invariant), shape_distance_oriented over all seven (chirality-sensitive via i7's reflection sign-flip).
think Measurement beats memory on the thresholds: built with a temporary diag mode, ran on metal, read the real distances, then set the crux ceilings and removed the scaffolding.
obs GREEN on the first full metal run, no algorithm reds. The separation is decisive and measured: d_rot=8.3e-15, d_mir=1.2e-14 (float-exact same form over i1..i6), d_scale=0.005 (the discrete-rescaling residue), d_diff=14.4 (the plus, a different shape), d_mir_oriented=11.3 (the chirality signal from i7). The different shape sits ~2800x the scaled distance and past 10x every same-shape transform -- one number tells same form from different where no single Hu value can.
obs Compose not braid held clean: the module owns only the metric (the signed-log transform and the sum of absolute differences over two HuSet values), reads no pixel, writes no image, touches no codec or color -- the smallest layer above the reader it compares. hu_moments owns the invariants, label owns the LabelMap.
obs Bounded before a byte: signed logs in f64 exactly as hu_moments reads its invariants so no accumulator wraps; the compared span bounded by the seven-long signature; hu_zero_floor (1e-12) folds a sub-floor magnitude to exactly zero so a symmetric shape's zero invariants never become a negative infinity.
obs TAME style bans clean, width-check exit 0, plain 7-bit ASCII, living-docs + living-card GREEN. The witness reads its GREEN claim with native `assert selftest.out contains` (REDS #76/#85 loom), never a shell grep.
obs Council rota lap deep-read active-designing/20260618-184912_growing-a-language.md (item 12) -- stand on proven ground, wear a thin costume, own the core by path, diverge by strengthening; applied directly, shape_match stands on the proven hu_moments and is the thinnest possible layer above it, a pure function over two fingerprints.
